# This Git repository is rooted at the Windows home directory.
# Ignore everything by default so personal files, secrets, caches, reports,
# generated artifacts, and tool state are not accidentally committed.
*

# Versioned project files.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!speech_recognition_ai.py
!text_to_speech_ai.py

# Python/tooling caches.
/.mypy_cache/
/__pycache__/
